pg:ModelsAndTable sen0414:hasPanel pg:ModelFiles, pg:ModelTimes, pg:MemoryAndGpuLimits .
pg:Transcribing sen0414:hasPanel pg:ResultStructure, pg:TextVersusBook, pg:LanguagesAndDetection .
